## L5 Stack Components

L5Components {
  Framework
  StateManagement
  Database
  ORM
  TestRunner
  Deployment
  CICD
  APIFramework
  RealtimeLib
  QueueSystem
}

## Components by Layer

ComponentsByLayer {
  *all* => TestRunner
  WebUI => Framework, StateManagement
  MobileUI => Framework, StateManagement
  DesktopUI => Framework, StateManagement
  Server => Framework
  API => Framework
  CLI => Framework
  Library => ...
  DAL => Database, ORM
  Worker => QueueSystem
  Realtime => RealtimeLib
}

## Detection Process

determineL5(ecosystem, layers) {
  relevantComponents = flatten(layers.map(l => ComponentsByLayer[l]))
  (no source code) => recommendStack(ecosystem, relevantComponents)
  (source code exists) => analyzeStack |> presentFindings |> confirm
}

recommendStack(ecosystem, components) {
  For each component in components:
    Suggest default based on ecosystem
    Present alternatives
    Allow custom choice
}

analyzeStack() {
  For each L5Component => detect from package files, config, imports
  Default StateManagement if layers include UI
}
